1
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,079
What is it?

2
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:43,000
Lin Kanshan went back to the mainland.

3
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,079
How could you let this happen?

4
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:48,359
Director Zhu's authority expired yesterday.

5
00:01:48,519 --> 00:01:49,920
It was still valid.

6
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,359
He signed off on it.

7
00:01:53,599 --> 00:01:55,120
Should we order him to return immediately?

8
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,920
He failed the polygraph.

9
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,719
There's reason to suspect he defected.

10
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:02,799
Starting now,

11
00:02:02,799 --> 00:02:03,840
put Lin Kanshan on the

12
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:06,159
high-sensitivity, high-alert watch list.

13
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,680
As soon as he comes back,

14
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,719
arrest him immediately.

15
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:09,599
Understood.

16
00:02:14,479 --> 00:02:15,120
It's me.

17
00:02:15,439 --> 00:02:16,400
I'm back.

18
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,439
Where's my phone?

19
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:43,560
Sorry about that.

20
00:02:43,639 --> 00:02:44,560
My machine broke down.

21
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,960
I'll come back in a bit.

22
00:02:46,639 --> 00:02:48,080
I can't find my phone.

23
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:51,400
Could you dial a number for me?

24
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:58,960
Come in.

25
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,479
Coming! Coming!

26
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:33,080
Did you come back this time

27
00:03:34,039 --> 00:03:35,360
to visit family,

28
00:03:36,879 --> 00:03:39,520
or just dropping by while passing through?

29
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:40,879
I'm not leaving.

30
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:42,520
From now on,

31
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,400
just like before...

32
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:52,000
I'm never leaving again.

33
00:04:15,639 --> 00:04:21,000
Welcome, welcome! A very warm welcome!

34
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:23,680
Hello.

35
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,279
Hello, Chief.

36
00:04:25,279 --> 00:04:26,079
You've thought of everything.

37
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:27,240
It's the least we could do.

38
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,519
This way, please.

39
00:04:30,199 --> 00:04:45,319
Welcome, welcome! A very warm welcome!

40
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,279
In your opinion,

41
00:04:56,079 --> 00:04:58,240
why did Jiang Zaizhen defect?

42
00:04:58,639 --> 00:04:59,240
Did Old Zhu

43
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,199
ever talk to you

44
00:05:01,519 --> 00:05:02,399
about Jiang Zaizhen?

45
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,160
Looking for the restroom?

46
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,399
There's none up the hill.

47
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:21,680
It's down at the bottom.

48
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:24,279
Don't trouble yourself.

49
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:25,759
I already went.

50
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:27,959
Old comrade,

51
00:06:27,959 --> 00:06:29,279
you've got good skills.

52
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,079
Easily worth

53
00:06:30,079 --> 00:06:31,800
at least three thousand yuan a month.

54
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:32,879
If it's something I enjoy,

55
00:06:32,879 --> 00:06:34,079
I'd do it for free.

56
00:06:35,839 --> 00:06:37,000
It's only been a few years,

57
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,199
how did your hair go completely white?

58
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,360
Still look sharper than Zheng Guiping, don't I?

59
00:06:42,439 --> 00:06:43,879
My goal is,

60
00:06:43,879 --> 00:06:45,879
if I can't catch him, I'll outlive him.

61
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,759
Don't worry, you'll outlast him.

62
00:06:48,079 --> 00:06:49,199
When I walked into the park earlier,

63
00:06:49,199 --> 00:06:50,199
I spotted you right away.

64
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,439
Didn't have time to hide?

65
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:56,000
Or did you try to hide and fail?

66
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,519
If I really wanted to hide from you,

67
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:58,560
do you think you could find me?

68
00:06:58,800 --> 00:06:59,720
Hard to say.

69
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,319
Some old comrades,

70
00:07:01,319 --> 00:07:02,879
with nothing to do after retiring,

71
00:07:03,199 --> 00:07:04,639
their tradecraft skills

72
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:06,319
inevitably get a bit rusty.

73
00:07:06,319 --> 00:07:07,040
It's only natural.

74
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,720
Stubborn as ever.

75
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,560
Who was it

76
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,519
that made a fool of himself on his first meet?

77
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,160
Got diarrhea,

78
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,959
and had me bring him toilet paper in the restroom.

79
00:07:15,959 --> 00:07:17,600
I couldn't help getting an upset stomach!

80
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:18,959
Well, I didn't bring paper today.

81
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,600
I brought a big pair of shears.

82
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:23,319
Look at you.

83
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,600
Doesn't this old comrade look like

84
00:07:25,839 --> 00:07:27,720
a rehired parks bureau gardener?

85
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:30,040
More like an old temple keeper

86
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,600
kicked out for stealing offerings.

87
00:07:34,959 --> 00:07:36,279
Quiet place, isn't it?

88
00:07:36,319 --> 00:07:37,920
Back in the day, if you had too much to drink

89
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:40,560
and felt like belting out old Tainan love songs,

90
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,720
as long as you didn't sound too awful,

91
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,920
nobody would bother you.

92
00:07:44,519 --> 00:07:46,519
No use dwelling on past glories.

93
00:07:47,199 --> 00:07:48,519
Getting older by the day,

94
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,480
and my alcohol tolerance is getting worse.

95
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:54,759
All the embarrassing things I did when drunk,

96
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,800
I won't get a chance to repeat them now.

97
00:07:58,079 --> 00:08:00,600
I'd rather just behave myself

98
00:08:00,959 --> 00:08:03,160
and stay home playing online games.

99
00:08:04,279 --> 00:08:05,199
Online games?

100
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:07,120
Can you even keep up with the times?

101
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:09,399
Audition or Age of Empires?

102
00:08:10,399 --> 00:08:11,800
You couldn't beat me at either one.

103
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,759
Lin Kanshan

104
00:08:18,639 --> 00:08:19,519
Pan Shuimei

105
00:08:20,319 --> 00:08:21,240
Xu Liting

106
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,759
Lu Xinwei

107
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:25,959
Did you memorize them?

108
00:08:27,839 --> 00:08:29,360
I'm this old, how could I remember?

109
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:33,039
On the Sina gaming forum,

110
00:08:33,279 --> 00:08:34,720
there's a user named Xiaoyaoniao.

111
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:35,960
Starting tonight,

112
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:38,320
he'll post online game walkthroughs

113
00:08:38,639 --> 00:08:39,600
for four days in a row.

114
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:42,080
All the numbers in them are Morse code.

115
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:46,080
Combined, they reveal their detailed profiles.

116
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,159
Check them as fast as you can.

117
00:08:48,559 --> 00:08:49,960
The posts will be deleted afterward.

118
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:54,600
These are all official MIB operatives.

119
00:08:55,639 --> 00:08:58,720
Some have been undercover on the mainland for nearly 20 years.

120
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,519
20 whole years...

121
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,519
I've been searching for this list

122
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:08,679
so long my teeth have nearly all fallen out.

123
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:11,320
Zhu Yingjia just retired,

124
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:14,840
and right at this moment, the list suddenly surfaces.

125
00:09:15,399 --> 00:09:16,600
If this is his doing,

126
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:22,200
would you say I'm being lured into a trap,

127
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:23,799
walking right into his net?

128
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:30,159
A full 20 years.

129
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:32,679
Most of them were arrested,

130
00:09:32,679 --> 00:09:33,399
or they fled.

131
00:09:33,399 --> 00:09:34,600
Barely any of them are left.

132
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,799
Coming here when it's so dangerous...

133
00:09:38,919 --> 00:09:40,159
Did you miss me,

134
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:42,799
or was there something we had to discuss in person?

135
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,240
Huanyu 10.

136
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:48,919
There's a leak.

137
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,320
The MIB has been eyeing

138
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,559
761 and 762

139
00:09:55,559 --> 00:09:56,399
for over 20 years.

140
00:09:56,679 --> 00:09:58,159
This is exactly what they've always wanted.

141
00:09:58,759 --> 00:10:00,200
How much was leaked this time?

142
00:10:01,879 --> 00:10:03,799
More than one department will lose data,

143
00:10:04,519 --> 00:10:05,960
and it's more than just one piece of intelligence.

144
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,879
If this pulls through,

145
00:10:08,679 --> 00:10:10,480
Zheng Guiping will rise straight to the top.

146
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,279
So he'll do whatever it takes

147
00:10:12,279 --> 00:10:14,200
to get the goods to Taiwan, China.

148
00:10:14,639 --> 00:10:15,600
Who's the seller?

149
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,600
I only know the courier.

150
00:10:20,279 --> 00:10:22,200
Taiwan, China will send someone to make the trade.

151
00:10:23,159 --> 00:10:24,039
Don't you have the list?

152
00:10:24,039 --> 00:10:25,399
Just follow the trail.

153
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,879
The countdown for Huanyu 10 has begun.

154
00:10:28,879 --> 00:10:30,360
We have to race against time again.

155
00:10:31,039 --> 00:10:32,039
It's like this every time.

156
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,519
Running ourselves ragged.

157
00:10:33,919 --> 00:10:35,159
Go jog a bit, then.

158
00:10:35,159 --> 00:10:36,600
Isn't exercise good for you?

159
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,440
Otherwise your legs will get stiff.

160
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,720
I hope we get to meet again next time.

161
00:10:42,039 --> 00:10:43,879
I can guarantee your safe return,

162
00:10:45,159 --> 00:10:47,320
but you must also promise to return safely.

163
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,399
You said it yourself.

164
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:52,159
Then you have to let me steal more intel.

165
00:10:53,559 --> 00:10:54,840
Otherwise, I can't meet my quota,

166
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,000
and things will get messy.

167
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:58,279
We at the MIB

168
00:10:58,279 --> 00:10:59,120
are "very dedicated" too,

169
00:10:59,120 --> 00:10:59,759
aren't we?

170
00:11:00,519 --> 00:11:02,240
I've prepared plenty of goods for you this time

171
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,159
to take back,

172
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,840
so you're guaranteed a reward.

173
00:11:05,559 --> 00:11:06,639
If you think it's necessary,

174
00:11:06,919 --> 00:11:08,360
we can make the act more convincing:

175
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,639
issue an expulsion order against you,

176
00:11:11,279 --> 00:11:12,600
banning you from the mainland.

177
00:11:12,759 --> 00:11:13,159
Don't.

178
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:18,120
If that happens,

179
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:21,679
I really won't ever be able to return.

180
00:11:29,399 --> 00:11:31,120
When the two sides reunite,

181
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,279
I'll go to the airport

182
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:35,679
with gongs and drums

183
00:11:36,399 --> 00:11:37,200
to welcome you back.

184
00:11:39,519 --> 00:11:40,320
Take care.

185
00:11:40,679 --> 00:11:41,480
Take care.

186
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,840
Boss Ding, it's Xiao Lin.

187
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,759
Lin Kanshan from Taipei.

188
00:12:09,039 --> 00:12:10,320
About buying the hotel,

189
00:12:11,559 --> 00:12:12,679
the price stays the same.

190
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:14,600
I can throw in some land,

191
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:17,080
plots in the suburbs and on Shengli Road.

192
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:17,919
Take your pick.

193
00:12:18,039 --> 00:12:19,080
But I want Hong Kong dollars.

194
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,039
US dollars work too.

195
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:23,480
The sooner, the better, of course.

196
00:12:23,679 --> 00:12:25,039
A week won't work?

197
00:12:25,399 --> 00:12:26,639
How about ten days?

198
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:28,559
Deepening cross-strait integration,

199
00:12:28,559 --> 00:12:30,399
and shaping a shared vision for development.

200
00:12:30,519 --> 00:12:32,519
A warm welcome to friends

201
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:33,559
from all walks of life across the strait.

202
00:12:34,159 --> 00:12:34,919
Cross-strait cooperation,

203
00:12:34,919 --> 00:12:35,840
with Fujian and Taiwan, China leading.

204
00:12:36,159 --> 00:12:38,200
We will kick things off

205
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:39,000
with the fair's first dialogue.

206
00:12:39,399 --> 00:12:40,960
Today, nearly a hundred

207
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:42,080
outstanding cross-strait entrepreneurs

208
00:12:42,519 --> 00:12:43,320
have gathered to exchange ideas,

209
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,240
build platforms,

210
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,120
and foster cooperation.

211
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:47,200
Many business leaders are already here,

212
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:48,360
and even more guests

213
00:12:48,519 --> 00:12:49,440
are on their way.

214
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:50,360
In the days ahead,

215
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:52,320
we will also take part in a series of events,

216
00:12:52,559 --> 00:12:53,360
including visiting Nanjing

217
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,799
to pay respects at Sun Yat-sen Mausoleum,

218
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:57,519
visiting Guoshang Cemetery in Tengchong,

219
00:12:57,879 --> 00:12:59,159
to honor those who, to retake Tengchong,

220
00:12:59,159 --> 00:13:00,240
heroically gave their lives—

221
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:02,320
the 20th Group Army of the Chinese Expeditionary Force,

222
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,120
and all their fallen soldiers—

223
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:06,080
as well as 28 other exchange programs.

224
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,960
At the same time, we eagerly look forward to

225
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,000
the highly anticipated

226
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:11,519
rollout of the cross-strait trade pact.

227
00:13:20,519 --> 00:13:20,879
Section Chief.

228
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:22,279
Great speech today.

229
00:13:22,279 --> 00:13:23,039
Thank you for your hard work.

230
00:13:24,159 --> 00:13:25,159
President Wang wasn't here today,

231
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:27,639
so I truly appreciate it.

232
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:28,879
Thank you, thank you.

233
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:30,200
I really must thank you.

234
00:13:30,279 --> 00:13:31,000
Thank you, thank you.

235
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:31,320
All right.

236
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,559
All right, take care.

237
00:13:55,639 --> 00:13:57,039
I saw you two earlier.

238
00:13:57,879 --> 00:13:59,240
Nobody's allowed to leave tonight!

239
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:00,240
Usual rules:

240
00:14:00,559 --> 00:14:01,919
whoever throws up first picks up the tab.

241
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:03,519
The three of us...

242
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,720
how long has it been since we hung out?

243
00:14:06,159 --> 00:14:07,279
You're just too busy.

244
00:14:07,279 --> 00:14:08,919
Boss He and I run into each other a lot.

245
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:10,360
We see each other every couple of days.

246
00:14:10,559 --> 00:14:12,480
Can't call him Brother Qi anymore.

247
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:13,759
I heard it just now.

248
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:16,159
People have started calling him Boss Qi.

249
00:14:17,399 --> 00:14:18,679
Whoever can make me rich,

250
00:14:18,679 --> 00:14:19,960
forget calling him "boss,"

251
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:21,480
I'd even call him my ancestor.

252
00:14:21,679 --> 00:14:22,559
Sure thing, sure thing.

253
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,240
Risking your life for money, huh?

254
00:14:24,399 --> 00:14:25,720
Drinking with clients recently,

255
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,279
I drank until I had a fever.

256
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,679
Only after going to the hospital did I find out

257
00:14:28,799 --> 00:14:30,039
it was acute appendicitis.

258
00:14:30,159 --> 00:14:31,480
I almost died in that hospital bed.

259
00:14:31,799 --> 00:14:32,600
Seriously, though.

260
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:33,600
On the mainland,

261
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:35,559
you two are the only family I have.

262
00:14:36,039 --> 00:14:38,000
No one else would pour their heart out.

263
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:40,039
Lying in the hospital having surgery,

264
00:14:40,159 --> 00:14:41,320
getting my appendix removed,

265
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:43,120
not a single girlfriend showed up.

266
00:14:43,799 --> 00:14:46,080
Only Brother Xiao stayed by my bed.

267
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:47,960
Being a brother like that,

268
00:14:48,759 --> 00:14:49,440
I've got nothing but respect.

269
00:14:51,759 --> 00:14:52,720
Where's Wen Zongshu?

270
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:54,559
I saw him right here a moment ago.

271
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,720
That fortune-telling thing,

272
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:57,039
I really need to get it cleared up.

273
00:14:57,039 --> 00:14:57,759
Do you guys remember

274
00:14:57,759 --> 00:14:58,879
what fortune he read for me last time?

275
00:14:59,759 --> 00:15:01,240
"In youth..."

276
00:15:01,519 --> 00:15:02,200
"In youth," what was it again?

277
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:04,840
In youth, proud of a pen that could touch the clouds.

278
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,159
He's got the better memory.

279
00:15:06,279 --> 00:15:07,600
I thought it was just that one line.

280
00:15:07,679 --> 00:15:08,919
Who knew there was more to it?

281
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:10,919
"Now the spring flowers have all fallen,"

282
00:15:10,919 --> 00:15:12,120
"leaving a heart full of bleakness."

283
00:15:12,759 --> 00:15:14,159
I thought I had a blessed fate.

284
00:15:14,559 --> 00:15:16,120
In youth, proud of a pen that could touch the clouds.

285
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:16,799
Sounds impressive, right?

286
00:15:16,799 --> 00:15:18,120
Turns out there's a second line.

287
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:19,200
In the end, it all comes to nothing.

288
00:15:19,399 --> 00:15:20,639
Then why am I busting my back every day?

289
00:15:20,639 --> 00:15:21,600
What's the point of it all?

290
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:23,240
Fortune tellers only tell you what sounds good.

291
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:24,799
They won't bring up the bad stuff.

292
00:15:24,879 --> 00:15:26,000
If they told you, you'd just get mad.

293
00:15:26,679 --> 00:15:28,279
If you believe it, it's real;

294
00:15:28,519 --> 00:15:29,960
if you don't, it's fake.

295
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,240
It's just a line of poetry.

296
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:35,039
It's obvious you're still young.

297
00:15:35,799 --> 00:15:36,679
What you've lived through...

298
00:15:37,519 --> 00:15:38,399
is still too little.

299
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,279
When my mom fell ill,

300
00:15:41,639 --> 00:15:43,440
we tried every possible medical treatment.

301
00:15:43,759 --> 00:15:44,840
Neither better nor worse.

302
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:46,759
She couldn't pass on,

303
00:15:46,759 --> 00:15:47,639
nor could she stay and get well.

304
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,000
I went to a temple to ask.

305
00:15:49,519 --> 00:15:50,399
Asked when my mother

306
00:15:50,399 --> 00:15:51,600
would finally stop suffering.

307
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:52,720
The master said,

308
00:15:53,480 --> 00:15:54,480
"Life is a script.

309
00:15:55,039 --> 00:15:56,440
Before she finishes the suffering that's written,

310
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,399
she cannot go."

311
00:15:57,799 --> 00:15:59,080
By your logic,

312
00:15:59,279 --> 00:16:00,919
everything is already written?

313
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:03,320
How the three of us met,

314
00:16:03,519 --> 00:16:04,679
the days we see each other,

315
00:16:04,679 --> 00:16:07,879
right, wrong, love, hate, none can change?

316
00:16:08,159 --> 00:16:09,679
Makes sense to me.

317
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:11,440
Look at this line of work we're in.

318
00:16:11,639 --> 00:16:13,399
In this world, you can quit anything else.

319
00:16:13,879 --> 00:16:15,080
Even a thief

320
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,320
can wash his hands and retire.

321
00:16:17,039 --> 00:16:18,759
But in our business,

322
00:16:19,559 --> 00:16:20,639
no matter how painful or exhausting,

323
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:22,519
once you're on this ship,

324
00:16:23,679 --> 00:16:25,000
there's no getting off.

325
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:29,879
If you don't want to do it,

326
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,240
you can walk away from anything.

327
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:33,799
What, you thinking of jumping ship?

328
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:38,480
I'm thinking of using the restroom.

329
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:39,679
You guys keep drinking.

330
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:21,039
A newly appointed official in Taiwan, China,

331
00:17:21,039 --> 00:17:21,960
asked me to look for you.

332
00:17:23,359 --> 00:17:24,359
Skipping class without leave?

333
00:17:24,359 --> 00:17:25,279
That counts as truancy.

334
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:26,799
Didn't the schools in Taipei

335
00:17:27,039 --> 00:17:28,359
teach you about discipline?

336
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:32,480
How does our script play out?

337
00:17:34,519 --> 00:17:35,720
On one side is the new official,

338
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:37,400
on the other, an old friend.

339
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:40,279
Are you going to help me or screw me over?

340
00:17:41,359 --> 00:17:42,720
The mainland is governed by the rule of law.

341
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:43,960
I'm just a nobody

342
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:45,160
who has always obeyed the law.

343
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,039
Don't worry.

344
00:17:46,039 --> 00:17:47,599
I won't turn into a murderer.

345
00:17:50,319 --> 00:17:51,480
They told me to pass along a message.

346
00:17:51,839 --> 00:17:53,440
Once the Cultural and Trade Forum ends,

347
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:54,519
you are to head back immediately.

348
00:18:01,720 --> 00:18:02,720
And if I don't?

349
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:11,680
Once your time is up,

350
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:13,960
if someone else comes looking for trouble,

351
00:18:14,279 --> 00:18:15,880
they won't be as gentle as I am.

352
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:23,000
Talking business even in the restroom?

353
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:25,200
No need to race against the clock like that.

354
00:18:25,839 --> 00:18:27,279
The Cultural and Trade Forum only lasts a week.

355
00:18:27,759 --> 00:18:29,279
In the blink of an eye, there are only six days left.

356
00:18:29,599 --> 00:18:30,599
I'd better hurry.

357
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:47,119
Chen Leyuan is forcing me to go back.

358
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:49,400
You signed off on sending me to the mainland,

359
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,559
and now he refuses to honor it.

360
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:51,720
The moment I go back,

361
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:53,079
he'll arrest me and put me in confinement.

362
00:18:53,240 --> 00:18:53,960
Right?

363
00:18:55,799 --> 00:18:57,079
The MIB

364
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:59,319
isn't made of flimsy paper.

365
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:02,359
Years of rules can't just be broken.

366
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:04,720
If it really comes to that,

367
00:19:05,119 --> 00:19:06,440
I'll stage a hunger strike at the gate

368
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:07,519
just to get you out.

369
00:19:08,079 --> 00:19:09,519
I've become a thorn in his side.

370
00:19:09,519 --> 00:19:11,519
He won't rest until he gets rid of me.

371
00:19:12,079 --> 00:19:13,079
When the time comes,

372
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:15,119
I'll make things clear to the superiors.

373
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:16,559
Is there anything else?

374
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:18,039
I met with Ma Qi.

375
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:21,480
He's likely in touch with Chen Leyuan too,

376
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:22,359
and deeply involved.

377
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:24,279
One thing is certain:

378
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:26,000
he has betrayed the mainland.

379
00:19:26,519 --> 00:19:28,519
He wouldn't cast such a wide net in Taipei,

380
00:19:29,240 --> 00:19:30,960
abandoning even basic one-on-one contact protocol.

381
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:33,880
How do you know he isn't just an opportunist?

382
00:19:34,119 --> 00:19:36,039
Seeing that I'm about to retire,

383
00:19:36,039 --> 00:19:37,839
he's currying favor with Deputy Director Chen.

384
00:19:37,839 --> 00:19:39,319
Opportunism is a choice, too.

385
00:19:40,119 --> 00:19:41,640
If he can't get a meal on the mainland,

386
00:19:41,640 --> 00:19:43,359
he has to fight for a seat at the table in Taipei.

387
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:44,920
He has to bow to Cixi,

388
00:19:45,119 --> 00:19:46,079
and bow to Guangxu too.

389
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:47,799
I think he's trying

390
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:49,920
to sell himself out to us completely, inside and out.

391
00:19:50,079 --> 00:19:50,880
Alright.

392
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:52,400
We'll talk later.

393
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:58,359
When Ma Qi comes back to Taipei,

394
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:00,119
you can meet with him.

395
00:20:02,319 --> 00:20:03,559
Don't rush it.

396
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:05,880
Just wait a bit longer.

397
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:41,720
What is it?

398
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:44,359
Say something.

399
00:21:46,319 --> 00:21:47,240
Nothing.

400
00:21:47,799 --> 00:21:49,640
Just calling to see if you're asleep.

401
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:52,160
Can't sleep, or just don't want to?

402
00:21:53,160 --> 00:21:54,559
Are you reading novels again?

403
00:21:54,559 --> 00:21:56,200
I'm not reading novels.

404
00:21:56,759 --> 00:21:58,839
Why are you still up so late?

405
00:21:58,960 --> 00:22:00,319
I just got home.

406
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:02,960
I've been really busy lately.

407
00:22:04,279 --> 00:22:05,400
Didn't I tell you?

408
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:06,880
The Cultural Trade Forum,

409
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:07,839
the trade fair...

410
00:22:07,960 --> 00:22:09,200
These are big deals.

411
00:22:09,799 --> 00:22:11,200
Bringing honor to the family.

412
00:22:11,839 --> 00:22:13,799
Stop nagging me about getting married.

413
00:22:13,799 --> 00:22:14,839
With so many girlfriends,

414
00:22:14,839 --> 00:22:16,400
you've got to let me pick.

415
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:18,960
How's your blood pressure?

416
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:20,039
Is your hand still numb?

417
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:22,720
There's no talking to you.

418
00:22:23,160 --> 00:22:24,799
You go handle your big deals.

419
00:22:25,359 --> 00:22:26,240
I'm fine.

420
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:27,640
I don't need your concern.

421
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:28,319
Just an old codger like me...

422
00:22:28,319 --> 00:22:30,119
What do you mean you're fine?

423
00:22:30,240 --> 00:22:32,119
Just answer me when I ask.

424
00:22:32,480 --> 00:22:33,799
Is your hand numb or not?

425
00:22:33,799 --> 00:22:34,720
If you don't tell me,

426
00:22:34,720 --> 00:22:36,319
how can the doctor prescribe your meds?

427
00:22:36,319 --> 00:22:37,799
You never take it seriously.

428
00:22:37,799 --> 00:22:39,279
If you don't care, then don't treat it.

429
00:22:39,279 --> 00:22:41,279
Go home and let your arteries clog!

430
00:22:41,279 --> 00:22:42,680
Then no one will have to worry anymore.

431
00:22:43,640 --> 00:22:44,680
Why do you think I'm

432
00:22:44,680 --> 00:22:46,599
calling to nag you late at night?

433
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:03,880
When I was little, I kept coughing,

434
00:23:04,799 --> 00:23:05,799
and I didn't want to take medicine,

435
00:23:05,880 --> 00:23:07,119
so you'd hit me

436
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:09,480
and ask if I wanted to cough to death.

437
00:23:09,799 --> 00:23:11,319
Now I'm asking you the exact same thing.

438
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:13,480
I'm so busy every day,

439
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:15,440
yet I still have to call and worry about you.

440
00:23:17,079 --> 00:23:18,680
I'm terrified that you won't walk again.

441
00:23:18,680 --> 00:23:20,400
Do you even understand?

442
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:22,200
That's enough.

443
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:25,480
If you're tired, just rest.

444
00:23:26,640 --> 00:23:27,960
I know.

445
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:31,279
I'm sorry.

446
00:23:32,319 --> 00:23:33,440
I've been nagging you.

447
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:36,839
I'm lying here, unable to move at all.

448
00:23:37,480 --> 00:23:38,759
And you're not by my side.

449
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,640
I really don't know

450
00:23:42,559 --> 00:23:44,240
what the point of living is.

451
00:23:44,240 --> 00:23:45,519
What are you talking about?

452
00:23:45,839 --> 00:23:46,880
If you don't stay alive,

453
00:23:48,920 --> 00:23:50,920
who will I bring my wife home to?

454
00:23:52,839 --> 00:23:54,400
When I have a kid,

455
00:23:55,039 --> 00:23:56,720
don't you want to be called Grandpa?

456
00:23:56,880 --> 00:23:57,680
I do.

457
00:23:58,640 --> 00:23:59,680
Of course I do.

458
00:24:00,440 --> 00:24:01,839
But you never have one.

459
00:24:02,960 --> 00:24:03,720
I...

460
00:24:06,079 --> 00:24:06,599
Never mind.

461
00:24:07,039 --> 00:24:07,799
Forget it.

462
00:24:10,839 --> 00:24:12,599
You're the only family I have left.

463
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:15,599
Stop dwelling on all that, okay?

464
00:24:18,359 --> 00:24:19,920
Just wait for me to come back.

465
00:24:20,880 --> 00:24:22,319
Someday I'll bring my wife home,

466
00:24:23,920 --> 00:24:25,640
and have my kid call you Grandpa.

467
00:24:26,200 --> 00:24:27,480
Just be good, okay?

468
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:28,480
Listen to the nurses.

469
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:29,599
Stop arguing with them.

470
00:24:31,519 --> 00:24:32,920
Everything's fine with me over here.

471
00:24:32,920 --> 00:24:34,039
Everything is fine.

472
00:24:34,039 --> 00:24:35,480
You don't need to worry, okay?

473
00:24:40,119 --> 00:24:41,400
All right, get some sleep early.

474
00:24:42,279 --> 00:24:43,119
Don't think so much.

475
00:24:43,119 --> 00:24:44,519
You'll drift off soon enough.

476
00:24:46,119 --> 00:24:47,400
I'm going to hang up now.

477
00:24:50,039 --> 00:24:50,440
Okay.

478
00:24:54,880 --> 00:24:55,680
Dad.

479
00:27:21,000 --> 00:27:22,759
Coming to my place in the middle of the night,

480
00:27:23,519 --> 00:27:24,519
after drinking, too...

481
00:27:25,240 --> 00:27:26,759
It's certainly not because you missed me.

482
00:27:27,759 --> 00:27:29,240
What do you want to get off your chest?

483
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:33,400
Calling off the wedding?

484
00:27:39,960 --> 00:27:41,039
Do you still remember...

485
00:27:43,440 --> 00:27:45,799
...when we first met?

486
00:27:54,799 --> 00:27:56,079
1995.

487
00:27:56,960 --> 00:27:58,039
Right when I arrived on the mainland.

488
00:28:01,559 --> 00:28:02,799
Lately, whenever you get drunk,

489
00:28:03,440 --> 00:28:04,640
you love reminiscing about the past, don't you?

490
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:07,839
It's been almost 20 years.

491
00:28:10,279 --> 00:28:11,400
Back then,

492
00:28:11,519 --> 00:28:13,720
I had no idea I'd know you for this long.

493
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:17,279
Back then, I really thought...

494
00:28:17,279 --> 00:28:18,880
you were just a naive businessman from Taiwan, China.

495
00:28:19,839 --> 00:28:21,079
Who knew you'd turn out to be so shrewd?

496
00:28:22,119 --> 00:28:23,640
I even told Qian Wenying back then,

497
00:28:24,119 --> 00:28:24,960
"Don't be too ruthless.

498
00:28:25,640 --> 00:28:27,000
Just take some of his money and let it go."

499
00:28:29,839 --> 00:28:31,200
You think you didn't con me?

500
00:28:32,160 --> 00:28:33,920
Do you know how much money I spent on you?

501
00:28:37,200 --> 00:28:38,559
You're the boss, after all.

502
00:28:39,519 --> 00:28:41,839
Bosses are supposed to pay wages.

503
00:28:42,240 --> 00:28:43,880
Actually, I know everything.

504
00:28:44,640 --> 00:28:45,960
I remember everything.

505
00:28:48,839 --> 00:28:51,000
How could I forget how good you were to me?

506
00:29:09,079 --> 00:29:10,559
Coming over in the middle of the night,

507
00:29:11,720 --> 00:29:12,880
keeping me from getting any sleep,

508
00:29:13,680 --> 00:29:15,319
just to flatter me?

509
00:29:18,960 --> 00:29:19,759
That's why

510
00:29:22,119 --> 00:29:24,480
I came to say goodbye before leaving.

511
00:29:28,200 --> 00:29:29,519
I'm going back to my hometown.

512
00:29:32,440 --> 00:29:33,480
Why?

513
00:29:38,039 --> 00:29:39,400
I have to go back eventually.

514
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:43,920
What's the point of staying here forever?

515
00:29:48,759 --> 00:29:50,200
Isn't this your home?

516
00:29:52,519 --> 00:29:54,240
You made enough for a down payment off me,

517
00:29:54,599 --> 00:29:55,720
where else would you go?

518
00:30:03,079 --> 00:30:03,880
That's just a house.

519
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:05,519
Not a home.

520
00:30:16,680 --> 00:30:17,920
When I get old,

521
00:30:18,960 --> 00:30:20,160
I'll have to go back anyway.

522
00:30:21,200 --> 00:30:22,799
My mother hasn't been well lately.

523
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:24,880
She asked me to go back and take care of her.

524
00:30:31,920 --> 00:30:34,839
Where did you put my poetry notebook?

525
00:30:35,000 --> 00:30:36,200
I'll come over to pick it up.

526
00:30:52,640 --> 00:30:53,480
I'm not leaving.

527
00:30:54,160 --> 00:30:55,240
You didn't say you were leaving either.

528
00:30:57,599 --> 00:30:58,519
Where are you going?

529
00:31:03,880 --> 00:31:05,079
Have you ever wondered,

530
00:31:07,559 --> 00:31:08,960
if I hadn't met you,

531
00:31:09,519 --> 00:31:10,680
and you didn't know me,

532
00:31:12,319 --> 00:31:13,480
where I would be?

533
00:31:14,519 --> 00:31:15,960
And where would you be?

534
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:23,640
If it weren't for you,

535
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:27,480
I would've died long ago.

536
00:31:48,720 --> 00:31:50,039
Dying is easy.

537
00:31:53,240 --> 00:31:54,200
It's living on

538
00:31:57,359 --> 00:31:58,680
that's the hardest part.

539
00:32:18,759 --> 00:32:20,359
A-Bao, hand out the materials.

540
00:32:20,359 --> 00:32:21,079
Okay.

541
00:32:21,480 --> 00:32:24,039
Chief Baoshan is at Party School this week,

542
00:32:24,119 --> 00:32:25,759
so we won't wait for him for today's morning meeting.

543
00:32:27,039 --> 00:32:27,880
Everything in these documents

544
00:32:27,880 --> 00:32:28,920
shows Lin Kanshan's land acquisitions

545
00:32:28,920 --> 00:32:30,519
in the industrial park over the years.

546
00:32:30,519 --> 00:32:31,160
Near or far,

547
00:32:31,160 --> 00:32:32,079
big or small,

548
00:32:32,079 --> 00:32:33,960
they're all tied to the dual-use airport.

549
00:32:34,440 --> 00:32:35,359
Take a wild guess:

550
00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:37,160
What is he trying to pull off?

551
00:32:37,640 --> 00:32:38,759
The airport is expanding at the end of the year.

552
00:32:38,759 --> 00:32:39,640
I think Lin Kanshan definitely—

553
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:41,640
Don't rush to answer. Think about it first.

554
00:32:41,759 --> 00:32:42,599
Think it through.

555
00:32:43,039 --> 00:32:43,880
Put yourself in his shoes.

556
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:45,359
If you were Lin Kanshan,

557
00:32:45,359 --> 00:32:46,319
what would you do?

558
00:32:46,680 --> 00:32:47,960
Besides the airport expansion,

559
00:32:48,240 --> 00:32:49,440
and those vacant factory buildings...

560
00:32:49,440 --> 00:32:50,279
Besides turning a profit,

561
00:32:50,279 --> 00:32:51,000
how else could someone

562
00:32:51,000 --> 00:32:52,440
get deep into the airport?

563
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:54,839
Overlay this acquisition data

564
00:32:54,839 --> 00:32:56,880
onto the city map.

565
00:32:56,880 --> 00:32:58,200
Let's see what he's really up to.

566
00:32:58,519 --> 00:32:59,599
Don't worry about being far-fetched.

567
00:32:59,599 --> 00:33:00,799
I'm just afraid you won't think of it.

568
00:33:01,880 --> 00:33:02,640
Master,

569
00:33:02,799 --> 00:33:03,720
at last week's morning meeting,

570
00:33:03,720 --> 00:33:05,440
you said a crack had formed

571
00:33:05,440 --> 00:33:06,599
in Lin Kanshan's conviction.

572
00:33:06,960 --> 00:33:08,319
Do you think he might defect?

573
00:33:10,680 --> 00:33:12,160
Without absolute certainty,

574
00:33:12,559 --> 00:33:13,440
I can't say for sure.

575
00:33:14,960 --> 00:33:16,799
Word came from our friend in Taiwan, China.

576
00:33:18,640 --> 00:33:19,759
With Huanyu heading into space,

577
00:33:19,799 --> 00:33:21,640
they're doing everything they can

578
00:33:21,839 --> 00:33:23,000
to steal related intelligence,

579
00:33:23,240 --> 00:33:25,160
especially the booster technology.

580
00:33:28,319 --> 00:33:29,559
If that intelligence leaks,

581
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:32,559
could we repeat the disaster of 19 years ago?

582
00:33:32,680 --> 00:33:33,799
A Taiwan Strait crisis,

583
00:33:34,440 --> 00:33:35,319
all over again?

584
00:33:36,599 --> 00:33:38,079
Where is Ma Qi right now?

585
00:33:51,920 --> 00:33:53,559
Forgot your keycard again?

586
00:33:53,759 --> 00:33:55,400
How many have you replaced already?

587
00:33:56,680 --> 00:33:58,000
You're always so forgetful.

588
00:33:59,119 --> 00:33:59,839
Brother Qi.

589
00:34:07,440 --> 00:34:09,519
Just a few words, then I'll leave.

590
00:34:09,519 --> 00:34:10,639
Won't interrupt your romance.

591
00:34:10,679 --> 00:34:12,639
What romance?

592
00:34:13,559 --> 00:34:15,360
Honestly, I'm too exhausted to date anymore.

593
00:34:15,519 --> 00:34:16,559
Can't even break up.

594
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:17,760
Such a hassle.

595
00:34:18,199 --> 00:34:20,079
You didn't mind the hassle when you were starving.

596
00:34:20,559 --> 00:34:21,920
Now that you're full, you're sick of it.

597
00:34:22,159 --> 00:34:23,719
Are people in Taiwan, China this sloppy, too?

598
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:27,360
What's their problem now?

599
00:34:28,239 --> 00:34:30,719
Funds. They keep shrinking.

600
00:34:31,039 --> 00:34:32,960
Aren't they worried you'll buy on credit?

601
00:34:33,280 --> 00:34:34,599
What's the point of coming to me every day?

602
00:34:35,840 --> 00:34:36,960
Those guys...

603
00:34:37,360 --> 00:34:39,239
All they do is push me for results every day.

604
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:41,239
Asking the MIB for money

605
00:34:41,239 --> 00:34:42,360
is harder than taking their lives.

606
00:34:44,159 --> 00:34:45,920
Brother Qi, if we weren't so tight,

607
00:34:46,079 --> 00:34:47,519
how could I have the nerve to ask you for credit?

608
00:34:48,519 --> 00:34:50,360
Tell them: three strikes and you're out.

609
00:34:50,440 --> 00:34:51,440
If they don't pay up,

610
00:34:52,119 --> 00:34:53,920
they won't get a damn thing from me.

611
00:34:54,679 --> 00:34:57,119
As for what they asked me to look into...

612
00:34:57,480 --> 00:34:58,960
That female lieutenant who fled to the UK,

613
00:34:59,199 --> 00:35:00,039
there's news on her.

614
00:35:05,760 --> 00:35:07,639
They still want to meet with you.

615
00:35:08,239 --> 00:35:09,199
Talk things over in person.

616
00:35:10,639 --> 00:35:11,840
Come on, what do you say?

617
00:35:15,719 --> 00:35:17,760
Times are so tough in Taipei,

618
00:35:18,800 --> 00:35:20,320
they won't book me economy, will they?

619
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:43,559
Welcome.

620
00:35:48,320 --> 00:35:50,320
Let me lead the way. This way, please.

621
00:35:54,719 --> 00:35:55,159
Boss Zheng.

622
00:35:55,159 --> 00:35:56,079
Brother Ma! Brother Ma!

623
00:35:56,079 --> 00:35:56,920
It's an honor to finally meet you.

624
00:35:56,920 --> 00:35:57,920
Have a seat, please.

625
00:35:57,920 --> 00:35:58,599
Please, sit.

626
00:35:59,800 --> 00:36:00,559
Come, take a seat.

627
00:36:01,679 --> 00:36:03,360
A humble token from afar...

628
00:36:03,639 --> 00:36:05,280
This is all you ordered?

629
00:36:05,760 --> 00:36:07,159
And it's all vegetarian?

630
00:36:07,719 --> 00:36:09,320
The sashimi here is great.

631
00:36:09,719 --> 00:36:10,760
Did you order any?

632
00:36:10,760 --> 00:36:12,840
Drinks and a good chat are plenty.

633
00:36:15,119 --> 00:36:16,199
The economy in Taiwan, China,

634
00:36:16,199 --> 00:36:17,440
may not match the mainland's,

635
00:36:17,440 --> 00:36:20,079
but we can still budget for a decent meal.

636
00:36:20,199 --> 00:36:21,159
Have an appetizer first.

637
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:24,239
Later, I'll take you somewhere special.

638
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:25,920
Mullet roe.

639
00:36:26,159 --> 00:36:27,559
Let's save that for next time.

640
00:36:27,559 --> 00:36:29,280
Once the food safety issues here clear up,

641
00:36:29,280 --> 00:36:30,639
we can feast properly.

642
00:36:30,800 --> 00:36:32,079
Wouldn't want diarrhea again.

643
00:36:32,079 --> 00:36:33,280
You're right.

644
00:36:33,280 --> 00:36:34,880
The situation in Taiwan, China, right now

645
00:36:34,880 --> 00:36:36,760
really is like having diarrhea.

646
00:36:36,760 --> 00:36:39,039
Tainted flour, bread, and soy sauce...

647
00:36:39,480 --> 00:36:40,519
Now, even at Shilin Night Market,

648
00:36:40,519 --> 00:36:41,559
I don't dare eat there anymore.

649
00:36:41,719 --> 00:36:42,920
I'm terrified of food poisoning too.

650
00:36:44,599 --> 00:36:45,599
Mr. Ma,

651
00:36:46,159 --> 00:36:48,480
you seem a bit thinner in person.

652
00:36:49,599 --> 00:36:50,639
Quite different from what I pictured.

653
00:36:51,519 --> 00:36:52,559
Ever since my first day on the job,

654
00:36:52,559 --> 00:36:54,239
my boss has told me:

655
00:36:54,239 --> 00:36:56,239
"Never call when you can meet in person."

656
00:36:56,639 --> 00:36:57,559
Because communicating with someone

657
00:36:57,559 --> 00:36:59,039
means looking them in the eye.

658
00:36:59,239 --> 00:37:00,119
The exact same words,

659
00:37:00,440 --> 00:37:02,599
spoken face-to-face, make all the difference.

660
00:37:05,559 --> 00:37:07,280
You're a trustworthy man,

661
00:37:07,639 --> 00:37:09,280
and I trust my instincts.

662
00:37:09,400 --> 00:37:10,760
So, how do you want the payout?

663
00:37:11,039 --> 00:37:11,880
Cryptocurrency?

664
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:13,840
Underground banks from Taipei to the mainland...

665
00:37:13,840 --> 00:37:15,280
Haven't they always been hassle-free?

666
00:37:15,480 --> 00:37:16,400
Let's stick to the usual way.

667
00:37:16,559 --> 00:37:18,360
I've never trusted cryptocurrency.

668
00:37:18,360 --> 00:37:19,280
Feels like a scam.

669
00:37:20,239 --> 00:37:21,280
Once I have the cash,

670
00:37:22,000 --> 00:37:22,719
I'm going to...

671
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:23,639
buy property.

672
00:37:23,880 --> 00:37:24,840
All over the world.

673
00:37:24,840 --> 00:37:27,199
Bricks and mortar are the only things that give me peace.

674
00:37:29,840 --> 00:37:33,159
I heard Huanyu 10 is launching this year.

675
00:37:34,039 --> 00:37:35,679
How much intel do you have on it?

676
00:37:36,159 --> 00:37:37,679
Big or small, I want it all.

677
00:37:40,199 --> 00:37:41,599
I just scurry around,

678
00:37:41,599 --> 00:37:42,960
passing messages as a middleman.

679
00:37:43,599 --> 00:37:45,559
Getting media articles written is fine,

680
00:37:45,760 --> 00:37:48,119
but for something this big, I don't have the chops.

681
00:37:48,440 --> 00:37:50,159
Don't be so quick to turn me down.

682
00:37:50,159 --> 00:37:51,960
I know you have intel.

683
00:37:52,199 --> 00:37:54,079
Coming all this way,

684
00:37:54,320 --> 00:37:55,840
you can't leave empty-handed.

685
00:37:55,920 --> 00:37:57,719
The money you make here

686
00:37:57,840 --> 00:38:00,039
could easily buy you a villa in Taipei.

687
00:38:00,320 --> 00:38:01,800
Then you can compare Taipei

688
00:38:02,199 --> 00:38:03,400
to Tokyo,

689
00:38:03,519 --> 00:38:04,320
New York,

690
00:38:04,519 --> 00:38:05,400
Moscow,

691
00:38:05,400 --> 00:38:08,320
and Seoul for property prices.

692
00:38:08,519 --> 00:38:10,639
If you didn't trust me,

693
00:38:10,639 --> 00:38:12,719
you wouldn't be sitting here today.

694
00:38:12,920 --> 00:38:14,360
And if I didn't trust you,

695
00:38:14,760 --> 00:38:15,559
today,

696
00:38:15,639 --> 00:38:18,639
I wouldn't be raising this glass.

697
00:38:19,360 --> 00:38:21,719
Today is only the beginning.

698
00:38:22,199 --> 00:38:23,280
Here's to a fruitful partnership.

699
00:38:40,519 --> 00:38:41,719
So noisy!

700
00:38:53,480 --> 00:38:54,280
Don't move! Don't move!

701
00:38:54,280 --> 00:38:55,000
What are you doing?

702
00:38:55,719 --> 00:38:56,559
Where did Ma Qi go?

703
00:38:57,639 --> 00:38:58,320
What do you want?

704
00:38:58,599 --> 00:38:59,840
Did he go to Taiwan, China?

705
00:39:00,480 --> 00:39:01,440
Did he?

706
00:39:07,159 --> 00:39:08,400
If you know, why ask me?

707
00:39:34,280 --> 00:39:35,199
Mr. Ma.

708
00:39:35,800 --> 00:39:36,719
Good morning.

709
00:39:38,119 --> 00:39:39,239
Just a small token.

710
00:39:57,639 --> 00:39:59,119
Authentic Zhengyan tea from Niulankeng.

711
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:01,360
It's my favorite.

712
00:40:02,159 --> 00:40:03,079
Thank you for your thoughtfulness.

713
00:40:04,280 --> 00:40:05,679
My surname is Chen.

714
00:40:05,920 --> 00:40:06,800
No alias.

715
00:40:07,199 --> 00:40:08,119
Given name: Leyuan.

716
00:40:08,880 --> 00:40:09,719
A pleasure to meet you.

717
00:40:10,039 --> 00:40:10,920
I've heard of you.

718
00:40:11,559 --> 00:40:12,760
You took over Director Zhu's post.

719
00:40:13,360 --> 00:40:14,280
First time we've met.

720
00:40:14,960 --> 00:40:15,840
An outstanding talent indeed.

721
00:40:16,280 --> 00:40:17,360
You flatter me.

722
00:40:17,639 --> 00:40:18,559
What brings you here?

723
00:40:18,880 --> 00:40:20,760
I came to show my sincerity.

724
00:40:20,960 --> 00:40:23,440
I know Mr. Ma is leaving Taipei today,

725
00:40:23,440 --> 00:40:25,320
so I specially arranged

726
00:40:25,320 --> 00:40:27,480
a green channel to and from Taiwan, China.

727
00:40:27,480 --> 00:40:28,920
All the procedural hassles

728
00:40:28,920 --> 00:40:30,079
will be waived from now on.

729
00:40:32,880 --> 00:40:34,480
For such a small convenience,

730
00:40:34,880 --> 00:40:36,119
to trouble Director Chen

731
00:40:36,320 --> 00:40:37,239
to come all the way here in person.

732
00:40:39,159 --> 00:40:41,480
I am truly and sincerely

733
00:40:41,480 --> 00:40:43,280
hoping to build

734
00:40:43,280 --> 00:40:44,920
a long-term cooperation with Mr. Ma.

735
00:40:45,159 --> 00:40:46,079
One-on-one,

736
00:40:46,719 --> 00:40:47,639
confidential,

737
00:40:48,360 --> 00:40:49,559
and completely open.

738
00:40:55,039 --> 00:40:56,119
Our meeting here,

739
00:40:57,480 --> 00:40:58,559
does Boss Zheng know about it?

740
00:41:01,719 --> 00:41:03,000
He has only

741
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:05,559
three months and four days left to retire.

742
00:41:06,480 --> 00:41:08,719
I can treat you to mullet roe anytime.

743
00:41:09,320 --> 00:41:10,440
There's even fresher available.

744
00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:17,400
In Taipei,

745
00:41:18,679 --> 00:41:20,599
every single word I say to anyone,

746
00:41:21,079 --> 00:41:22,199
do you have to know all of it?

747
00:41:24,000 --> 00:41:26,159
As your subordinate, I'm just looking out for you.

748
00:41:26,639 --> 00:41:27,440
Coincidentally,

749
00:41:27,679 --> 00:41:28,440
I overheard you...

750
00:41:28,440 --> 00:41:30,360
When I, Chen Leyuan, make friends,

751
00:41:30,719 --> 00:41:32,920
I have always laid all cards on the table.

752
00:41:32,920 --> 00:41:35,599
So today, I might as well speak plainly.

753
00:41:35,599 --> 00:41:37,119
The West, South and North Korea,

754
00:41:37,400 --> 00:41:38,360
the mainland, Japan...

755
00:41:38,639 --> 00:41:39,880
For external intelligence,

756
00:41:40,199 --> 00:41:43,000
I will need a great deal of Mr. Ma's help.

757
00:41:43,559 --> 00:41:45,599
I wouldn't block my own path.

758
00:41:47,280 --> 00:41:50,119
"Drink yet one more cup of wine,"

759
00:41:50,119 --> 00:41:53,119
"past Yangguan, no old friends remain."

760
00:41:56,519 --> 00:41:57,599
Here's to a fruitful partnership.

761
00:42:35,679 --> 00:42:36,400
Excuse me, sir.

762
00:42:37,039 --> 00:42:38,280
My phone's dead.

763
00:42:38,280 --> 00:42:39,280
I have an urgent call to make.

764
00:42:39,280 --> 00:42:40,440
Could I borrow your phone for a moment?

765
00:42:40,760 --> 00:42:41,280
Sure.

766
00:42:49,280 --> 00:42:49,880
Hello.

767
00:42:49,920 --> 00:42:50,960
Is this Huaqiao Hotel?

768
00:42:50,960 --> 00:42:51,480
Yes, it is.

769
00:42:51,760 --> 00:42:52,360
I have a client

770
00:42:52,360 --> 00:42:54,400
who stayed in Room 1228 recently.

771
00:42:54,599 --> 00:42:55,920
No one is answering in his room.

772
00:42:56,119 --> 00:42:57,000
Did he check out?

773
00:42:57,079 --> 00:42:58,119
His last name is Yang.

774
00:42:58,679 --> 00:42:59,199
One moment, please.

775
00:42:59,199 --> 00:42:59,960
Nothing comes up?

776
00:43:00,039 --> 00:43:01,079
May I have your name, sir?

777
00:43:01,239 --> 00:43:02,920
Could you leave your contact information?

778
00:43:08,480 --> 00:43:09,559
I'm Wang Kai,

779
00:43:09,559 --> 00:43:11,280
inviting you to watch the drama series

780
00:43:11,280 --> 00:43:12,199
*Confrontation*.

781
00:43:12,599 --> 00:43:14,880
I feel like there's a look in your eyes,

782
00:43:14,880 --> 00:43:16,320
like you want to kill me.

783
00:43:16,320 --> 00:43:18,199
Facing death, yet acting so nonchalant.

784
00:43:18,559 --> 00:43:20,960
Lost contact with Ma Qi and Yang Shiwen.

785
00:43:20,960 --> 00:43:22,360
They've likely been arrested.

786
00:43:22,880 --> 00:43:23,719
What are you doing?

787
00:43:23,719 --> 00:43:24,760
We're on the same side!

788
00:43:24,760 --> 00:43:26,119
I work for Boss Qi!

789
00:43:26,119 --> 00:43:28,199
I've worked for State Security for years!

790
00:43:28,199 --> 00:43:30,559
Ma Qi left State Security a long time ago.

791
00:43:32,440 --> 00:43:33,079
Don't move!

792
00:43:33,320 --> 00:43:33,960
Ma Qi.

793
00:43:34,800 --> 00:43:35,440
Ma Qi.

794
00:43:35,679 --> 00:43:37,440
Have you figured out what he's thinking?
